                                "sense_id": "d4e2a9c6-06a2-39f8-8559-dfab9dc6628e",
                                "text": "And he inveighed against Candle-mas as an allotheistic thing, a burning of tapers to Februa; and he indicted the vanity of Shrove-tide, with its cock-scaling in honor not of Christ but Themistocles..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc043016-4b74-44d3-9f8b-1d857281818b",
                                "sense_id": "d4e2a9c6-06a2-39f8-8559-dfab9dc6628e",
                                "text": "Wearers of sheets prepared for a migration across the river. Down into the river they went, allotheistic teens, shawls wrapped snugly around them, to ford the river called Tokeneke, rock by rock."
                            }
                        ]
